---
layout: _layouts/base.njk
section: transmissions
description: Sealed transmissions from sp3ctr-zone. Hover or focus an entry to decrypt it.
extraScripts:
  - /js/transmissions.js
---
<h1>transmissions</h1>
<p class="prompt">newest first. hover or tab to an entry to decrypt it —
  step away and it reseals.</p>

<div class="log">
  <div class="signal"><span class="signal-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> SIGNAL LOCKED &middot; {{ collections.transmissions.length }} TRANSMISSIONS ON FILE</div>
{% for entry in collections.transmissions | reverse %}
  <article class="entry">
    <div class="entry-head">
      <span class="entry-date">{{ entry.date | dateDisplay }}</span>
      <span class="entry-subject">{{ entry.data.title }}</span>
    </div>
    <p class="cipher" tabindex="0" data-plain="{{ entry.data.message }}">[ sealed ]</p>
  </article>
{% endfor %}
</div>
